{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0025-s004", "text": "Vissa kommuner kan även erbjuda servicesedlar, med vilka du kan betala kostnaderna för privat vård, så att den är förmånlig för dig.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013511589651+0000-4/hb-c08-u0025-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.563537414965987, "peak": 0.29058837890625, "generation_seconds": 26.08261399809271, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0025-s005", "text": "Fråga mer vid din kommun.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013511589651+0000-4/hb-c08-u0025-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.647074829931973, "peak": 0.26007080078125, "generation_seconds": 6.3202014858834445, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0194-s001", "text": "Om barnet har en hemkommun i Finland , kan du ansöka om stöd för privat vård hos FPA.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013511589651+0000-4/hb-c08-u0194-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.010884353741497, "peak": 0.26361083984375, "generation_seconds": 15.96034674695693, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0194-s002", "text": "Producenten av småbarnspedagogik måste ha kommunens godkännande.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013511589651+0000-4/hb-c08-u0194-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.7817687074829935, "peak": 0.288116455078125, "generation_seconds": 12.448813789058477, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0195-s001", "text": "Du kan ansöka om privatvårdsstöd (yksityisen hoidon tuki), om", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013511589651+0000-4/hb-c08-u0195-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.921088435374149, "peak": 0.29766845703125, "generation_seconds": 13.159587375121191, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0196-s001", "text": "ditt barn som är under skolåldern är i privat dagvård, eller", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013511589651+0000-4/hb-c08-u0196-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.712108843537415, "peak": 0.317901611328125, "generation_seconds": 14.502859856002033, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0198-s001", "text": "barnet har någon annan privat skötare.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013511589651+0000-4/hb-c08-u0198-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.5526530612244898, "peak": 0.254058837890625, "generation_seconds": 12.078238651156425, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0199-s001", "text": "Du kan inte ansöka om privatvårdsstöd om skötaren är en medlem i barnets familj eller om barnet och skötaren bor i samma hushåll.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013511589651+0000-4/hb-c08-u0199-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.215238095238096, "peak": 0.318389892578125, "generation_seconds": 27.31930435402319, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
